{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1949,
    "dDurationMs": 2831,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the final installment of the beaker\nball balance problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4780,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you haven’t seen the first part, you\nshould probably watch that now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8740,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The link is in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10700,
    "dDurationMs": 5609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now assuming you have seen it, you know that\nthe balance tips towards the hanging acrylic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16309,
    "dDurationMs": 3851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ball when weighed against a beaker with a\nsubmerged ping pong ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20160,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what would happen if, instead of tethering\nthe ping pong ball to the base of the beaker,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23940,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was instead submerged by my finger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26120,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I posed this question in the last video and\nyou responded with thousands of comments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31070,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thirteen percent of you thought that the acrylic\nball beaker would be heavier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34450,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Twenty-nine percent thought the ping pong\nball beaker would be heavier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37410,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And 54 percent of you thought that they would\nbe balanced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40820,
    "dDurationMs": 12840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now let’s see what actually happens in\nthree, two, one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53660,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perfectly balanced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55280,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why is this the case?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57460,
    "dDurationMs": 4510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, just as in the previous experiment,\nboth balls displaced the same amount of water"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61970,
    "dDurationMs": 5079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they experienced the same upward buoyant\nforce equal to the weight of water they displace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67049,
    "dDurationMs": 5331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, there are equal and opposite downward\nforces on the water, making both beakers heavier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72380,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by this amount."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74110,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And our answer could stop here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76640,
    "dDurationMs": 3659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you are wondering why this result is\ndifferent from the previous case, consider"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80299,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that in the first part, the downward force\non the ping pong ball side was counteracted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84109,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the upward tension in the string."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86689,
    "dDurationMs": 3281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not any more, because there is no string."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89970,
    "dDurationMs": 4899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, the downward force from my hand is\nequal to the buoyant force minus the weight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94869,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the ping pong ball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96329,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that overall both beakers get heavier by\nthe same amount."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99070,
    "dDurationMs": 4499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is just the weight of water displaced by\nthe ping pong ball or the acrylic ball because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103569,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it has the same volume."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105189,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope you enjoyed this experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108439,
    "dDurationMs": 7061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have got another way of explaining\nthis, please let me know in the comments."
    } ]
  } ]
}
